Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.45,0:00:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:02:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The force of his strike alone\Nis in a class of its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cut through that tough-as-nails\Nmonster like it was tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing! That was absolutely amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.58,0:02:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who even is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.49,0:02:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have goosebumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.04,0:02:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight me, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mismatched Outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beat that member\Nof the Twelve Kasugai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, right here, I'm gonna beat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:03:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can manage that, that'll\Nmake me the most powerful of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go train more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't one of the twelve Kasugai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you not even tell that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.78,0:03:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I could tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.08,0:03:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your information, it was Tanji\Nro who was saying it was one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just repeating what\Nhe said to me earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that amateur couldn't\Nhave been one of those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.64,0:03:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did he tie me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it's not just a\Nsword he's quick with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,- Hey, you!\N- Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are not aware of what state your\Nbody is in, you shouldn't be fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.32,0:03:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your voice is too soft and\Nyou're walking too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said hold your horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tie these ropes right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.24,0:03:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GET ME.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DOWNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NNNNNNNNNNNNNNNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:04:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hello
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can hear me, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Gramps.
